Grau GbR developers are delighted to announce the release and immediate 
availability of PhotoXtractor - their first easy-to-use Linux and UNIX 
data recovery software for digital media and more.

PhotoXtractor can recover photos, images, digital camera RAW files, 
audio files, MP3 files, office documents and more with three single 
mouse clicks.

It supports most external media such as SD, MMC, CF I/II, MicroDrive, 
Card readers, USB flash drive, and more.

